[{"title":"如梦令","author":"纳兰性德","text":"万帐穹庐人醉，星影摇摇欲坠。\n归梦隔狼河，又被河声搅碎。\n还睡，还睡，解道醒来无味。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":936,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"百字令  宿汉儿村","author":"纳兰性德","text":"无情野火，趁西风烧遍、天涯芳草。\n榆塞重来冰雪里，冷入鬓丝吹老。\n牧马长嘶，征笳乱动，并入愁怀抱。\n定知今夕，庾郎瘦损多少。\n便是脑满肠肥，尚难消受，此荒烟落照。\n何况文园憔悴后，非复酒垆风调。\n回乐峰寒，受降城远，梦向家山绕。\n茫茫百感，凭高唯有清啸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":937,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沁园春","author":"纳兰性德","text":"丁巳重阳前三日，梦亡妇淡装素服，执手哽咽，语多不复能记。\n但临别有云：“衔恨愿为天上月，年年犹得向郎圆。\n”妇素未工诗，不知何以得此也，觉后感赋瞬息浮生，薄命如斯，低徊怎忘。\n记绣榻闲时，并吹戏雨；雕阑曲处，同倚斜阳。\n梦好难留，诗残莫续，赢得更深哭一场。\n遗容在，只灵飙一转，未许端详。\n重寻碧落茫茫。\n料短发、朝来定有霜。\n便人间天上，尘缘未断；春花秋叶，触绪还伤。\n欲结绸缪，翻惊摇落，减尽荀衣昨日香。\n真无奈，倩声声邻笛，谱出回肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":938,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤枣子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"风淅淅，雨织织。\n难怪春愁细细添。\n记不分明疑是梦，梦来还隔一重帘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":939,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明月棹孤舟  海淀","author":"纳兰性德","text":"一片亭亭空凝伫。\n趁西风霓裳偏舞。\n白鸟惊飞，菰蒲叶乱，断续浣纱人语。\n丹碧驳残秋夜雨。\n风吹去采菱越女。\n辘轳声断，昏鸦欲起，多少博山情绪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":940,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河传","author":"纳兰性德","text":"春浅，红怨。\n掩双环，微雨花间。\n画闲，无言暗将红泪弹。\n阑珊，香销轻梦还。\n斜倚画屏思往事。\n皆不是，空作相思字。\n忆当时，垂柳丝。\n花枝，满庭蝴蝶儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":941,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春","author":"纳兰性德","text":"一生一代一双人，争教两处消魂。\n相思相望不相亲，天为谁春？\n浆向蓝桥易乞，药成碧海难奔。\n若容相访饮牛津，相对忘贫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":942,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"桃花羞作无情死，感激东风。\n吹落娇红，飞入窗间伴懊侬。\n谁怜辛苦东阳瘦，也为春慵。\n不及芙蓉，一片幽情冷处浓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":943,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"谁翻乐府凄凉曲，风也萧萧，雨也萧萧，瘦尽灯花又一宵。\n不知何事萦怀抱，醒也无聊，醉也无聊，梦也何曾到谢桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":944,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"彤霞久绝飞琼字，人在谁边。\n人在谁边，今夜玉清眠不眠。\n香销被冷残灯灭，静数秋天。\n静数秋天，又误心期到下弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":945,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"明月多情应笑我，笑我如今，孤负春心，独自闲行独自吟。\n近来怕说当时事，结编兰襟。\n月浅灯深，梦里云归何处寻？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":946,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"土花曾染湘娥黛，铅泪难消。\n清韵谁敲，不是犀椎是凤翘。\n只应长伴端溪紫，割取秋潮。\n鹦鹉偷教，方响前头见玉箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":947,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"冷香萦遍红桥梦，梦觉城笳。\n月上桃花，雨歇春寒燕子家。\n箜篌别后谁能鼓，肠断天涯。\n暗损韶华，一缕茶烟透碧纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":948,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"拨灯书尽红笺也，依旧无聊。\n玉漏迢迢，梦里寒花隔玉箫。\n几竿修竹三更雨，叶叶萧萧。\n分付秋潮，莫误双鱼到谢桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":949,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"严宵拥絮频惊起，扑面霜空。\n斜汗朦胧，冷逼毡帷火不红。\n香篝翠被浑闲事，回首西风。\n数盏残钟，一穗灯花似梦中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":950,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"凉生露气湘弦润，暗滴花梢。\n帘影谁摇，燕蹴风丝上柳条。\n舞鹍镜匣开频掩，檀粉慵调。\n朝泪如潮，昨夜香衾觉梦遥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":951,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"海天谁放冰轮满，惆怅离情。\n莫说离情，但值良宵总泪零。\n只应碧落重相见，那是今生。\n可奈今生，刚作愁时又忆卿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":952,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"而今才道当时错，心绪凄迷。\n红泪偷垂，满眼春风百事非。\n情知此后来无计，强说欢期。\n一别如斯，落尽犁花月又西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":953,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"那能寂寞芳菲节，欲话生平。\n夜已三更。\n一阕悲歌泪暗零。\n须知秋叶春花促，点鬓星星。\n遇酒须倾，莫问千秋万岁名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":954,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"白衣裳凭朱栏立，凉月趖西。\n点鬓霜微，岁晏知君归不归。\n残更目断传书雁，尺素还稀。\n一味相思，准拟相看似旧时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":955,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"谢家庭院残更立，燕宿雕梁。\n月度银墙，不辨花丛那瓣香。\n此情已自成追忆，零落鸳鸯。\n雨歇微凉，十一年前梦一场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":956,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"非关癖爱轻模样，冷处偏佳。\n别有根芽，不是人间富贵花。\n谢娘别后谁能惜，漂泊天涯。\n寒月悲笳，万里西风瀚海沙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":957,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子  九日","author":"纳兰性德","text":"深秋绝塞谁相忆，木叶萧萧。\n乡路迢迢。\n六曲屏山和梦遥。\n佳时倍惜风光别，不为登高。\n只觉魂销。\n南雁归时更寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":958,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金人捧露盘  净业寺观莲，有怀荪友","author":"纳兰性德","text":"藕风轻，莲露冷，断虹收，正红窗、初上帘钩。\n田田翠盖，趁斜阳鱼浪香浮。\n此时画阁垂杨岸，睡起梳头。\n旧游踪，招提路，重到处，满离忧。\n想芙蓉湖上悠悠。\n红衣狼藉，卧看桃叶送兰舟。\n午风吹断江南梦，梦里菱讴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":959,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲 亡妇忌日有感","author":"纳兰性德","text":"此恨何时已。\n滴空阶、寒更雨歇，葬花天气。\n三载悠悠魂梦杳，是梦久应醒矣。\n料也觉、人间无味。\n不及夜台尘土隔，冷清清、一片埋愁地。\n钗钿约，竟抛弃。\n重泉若有双鱼寄。\n好知他、年来苦乐，与谁相倚。\n我自中宵成转侧，忍听湘弦重理。\n待结个、他生知己。\n还怕两人俱薄命，再缘悭、剩月零风里。\n清泪尽，纸灰起。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":960,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲  姜西溟言别，赋此赠之","author":"纳兰性德","text":"谁复留君住？\n叹人生、几翻离合，便成迟暮。\n最忆西窗同剪烛，却话家山夜雨。\n不道只、暂时相聚。\n衮衮长江萧萧木，送遥天、白雁哀鸣去。\n黄叶下，秋如许。\n曰归因甚添愁绪。\n料强似、冷烟寒月，栖迟梵宇。\n一事伤心君落魄，两鬓飘萧未遇。\n有解忆、长安儿女。\n裘敝入门空太息，信古来、才命真相负。\n身世恨，共谁语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":961,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲  慰西溟","author":"纳兰性德","text":"何事添凄咽？\n但由他、天公簸弄，莫教磨涅。\n失意每多如意少，终古几人称屈。\n须知道、福因才折。\n独卧藜床看北斗，背高城、玉笛吹成血。\n听谯鼓，二更彻。\n丈夫未肯因人热，且乘闲、五湖料理，扁舟一叶。\n泪似秋霖挥不尽，洒向野田黄蝶。\n须不羡、承明班列。\n马迹车尘忙未了，任西风、吹冷长安月。\n又萧寺，花如雪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":962,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"青衫湿","author":"纳兰性德","text":"近来无限伤心事，谁与话长更。\n从教分付，绿窗红泪，早雁初莺。\n当时领略，自尽断送，总负多情。\n忽疑君到，漆灯风飐，痴数春星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":963,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"丝雨如尘云著水，嫣香碎拾吴宫。\n百花冷暖避东风，酷怜娇易散，燕子学偎红。\n人说病宜随月减，恹恹却与春同。\n可能留蝶抱花丛，不成双梦影，翻笑杏梁空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":964,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"点滴芭蕉心欲碎，声声催忆当初。\n欲眠还展旧时书。\n鸳鸯小字，犹记手生疏。\n倦眼乍低缃帙乱，重看一半模糊。\n幽窗冷雨一灯孤。\n料应情尽，还道有情无？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":965,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"昨夜个人曾有约，严城玉漏三更。\n一钩新月几疏星。\n夜阑犹未寝，人静鼠窥灯。\n原是瞿唐风间阻，错教人恨无情。\n小阑干外寂无声。\n几回肠断处，风动护花铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":966,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙  孤雁","author":"纳兰性德","text":"霜冷离鸿惊失伴，有人同病相怜。\n拟凭尺素寄愁边，愁多书屡易，双泪落灯前。\n莫对月明思往事，也知消减年年。\n无端嘹唳一声传，西风吹只影，刚是早秋天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":967,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"飞絮飞花何处是？\n层冰积雪摧残。\n疏疏一树五更寒。\n爱他明月好，憔悴也相关。\n最是繁丝摇落后，转教人忆春山。\n湔裙梦断续应难，西风多少恨，吹不散眉弯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":968,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南乡子","author":"纳兰性德","text":"烟暖雨初收，落尽繁花小院幽。\n摘得一双红豆子，低头，说著分携泪暗流。\n人去似春休，卮酒曾将酹石尤。\n别自有人桃叶渡，扁舟，一种烟波各自愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":969,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南乡子  为亡妇题照","author":"纳兰性德","text":"泪咽却无声。\n只向从前悔薄情，凭仗丹青重省识，盈盈。\n一片伤心画不成。\n别语忒分明。\n午夜鹣鹣梦早醒。\n卿自早醒侬自梦，更更。\n泣尽风檐夜雨铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":970,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南楼令  塞外重九","author":"纳兰性德","text":"古木向人秋，惊蓬掠鬓稠。\n是重阳、何处堪愁。\n记得当年惆怅事，正风雨，下南楼。\n断梦几能留，香魂一哭休。\n怪凉蝉、空满衾裯。\n霜落乌啼浑不睡，偏想出，旧风流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":971,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南歌子  古戍","author":"纳兰性德","text":"古戍饥乌集，荒城野雉飞。\n何年劫火剩残灰，试看英雄碧血，满龙堆。\n玉帐空分垒，金笳已罢吹。\n东风回首尽成非，不道兴亡命也，岂人为。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":972,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昭君怨","author":"纳兰性德","text":"暮雨丝丝吹湿，倦柳愁荷风急。\n瘦骨不禁秋，总成愁。\n别有心情怎说？\n未是诉愁时节。\n谯鼓已三更，梦须成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":973,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇","author":"纳兰性德","text":"一种蛾眉，下弦不似初弦好。\n庾郎未老，何事伤心早？\n素壁斜辉，竹影横窗扫。\n空房悄，乌啼欲晓，又下西楼了。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":974,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇","author":"纳兰性德","text":"小院新凉，晚来顿觉罗衫薄。\n不成孤酌，形影空酬酢。\n萧寺怜君，别绪应萧索。\n西风恶，夕阳吹角，一阵槐花落。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":975,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇  咏风兰","author":"纳兰性德","text":"别样幽芬，更无浓艳催开处。\n凌波欲去，且为东风住。\n忒煞萧疏，怎耐秋如许？\n还留取，冷香半缕，第一湘江雨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":976,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇  黄花城早望","author":"纳兰性德","text":"五夜光寒，照来积雪平于栈。\n西风何限，自起披衣看。\n对此茫茫，不觉成长叹。\n何时旦，晓星欲散，飞起平沙雁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":977,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相见欢","author":"纳兰性德","text":"落花如梦凄迷，麝烟微，又是夕阳潜下小楼西。\n愁无限，消瘦尽，有谁知？\n闲教玉笼鹦鹉念郎诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":978,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相见欢","author":"纳兰性德","text":"微云一抹遥峰，冷溶溶，恰与个人清晓画眉同。\n红蜡泪，青绫被，水沉浓，却与黄茅野店听西风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":979,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"身向云山那畔行。\n北风吹断马嘶声。\n深秋远塞若为情。\n一抹晚烟荒戍垒，半竿斜日旧关城。\n古今幽恨几时平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":980,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"消息谁传到拒霜？\n两行斜雁碧天长，晚秋风景倍凄凉。\n银蒜押帘人寂寂，玉钗敲烛信茫茫。\n黄花开也近重阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":981,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"莲漏三声烛半条，杏花微鱼湿轻绡，那将红豆寄无聊？\n春色已看浓似酒，归期安得信如潮，离魂入夜倩谁招？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":982,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"十里湖光载酒游，青帘低映白蘋洲。\n西风听彻采菱讴。\n沙岸有时双袖拥，画船何处一竿收。\n归来无语晚妆楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":983,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"谁道飘零不可怜，旧游时节好花天，断肠人去自经年。\n一片晕红才著雨，几丝柔绿乍和烟。\n倩魂销尽夕阳前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":984,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"风髻抛残秋草生。\n高梧湿月冷无声。\n当时七夕记深盟。\n信得羽衣传钿合，悔教罗袜葬倾城。\n人间空唱雨淋铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":985,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"杨柳千条送马蹄，北来征雁旧南飞，客中谁与换春衣。\n终古闲情归落照，一春幽梦逐游丝，信回刚道别多时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":986,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"万里阴山万里沙，谁将绿鬓斗霜华。\n年来强半在天涯。\n魂梦不离金屈戍，画图亲展玉鸦叉。\n生怜瘦减一分花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":987,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"伏雨朝寒悉不胜，那能还傍杏花行。\n去年高摘斗轻盈。\n漫惹炉烟双袖紫，空将酒晕一衫青。\n人间何处问多情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":988,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"残雪凝辉冷画屏。\n落梅横笛已三更，更无人处月胧明。\n我是人间惆怅客，知君何事泪纵横。\n断肠声里忆平生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":989,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"谁念西风独自凉。\n萧萧黄叶闭疏窗。\n沉思往事立残阳。\n被酒莫惊春睡重，赌书消得泼茶香。\n当时只道是寻常。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":990,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"记绾长条欲别难。\n盈盈自此隔银湾。\n便无风雪也摧残。\n青雀几时裁锦字，玉虫连夜剪春幡。\n不禁辛苦况相关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":991,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"欲寄愁心朔雁边，西风浊酒惨离颜。\n黄花时节碧云天。\n古戍烽烟迷斥堠，夕阳村落解鞍鞯。\n不知征战几人还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":992,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"已惯天涯莫浪愁，寒云衰草渐成秋。\n漫因睡起又登楼。\n伴我萧萧惟代马，笑人寂寂有牵牛。\n劳人只合一生休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":993,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"一半残阳下小楼，朱帘斜控软金钩。\n倚栏无绪不能愁。\n有个盈盈骑马过，薄妆浅黛亦风流。\n见人羞涩却回头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":994,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙  红桥怀古，和王阮亭韵","author":"纳兰性德","text":"无恙年年汴水流。\n一声水调短亭秋。\n旧时明月照扬州。\n曾是长堤牵锦缆，绿杨清瘦至今愁。\n玉钩斜路近迷楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":995,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙  姜女庙","author":"纳兰性德","text":"海色残阳影断霓，寒涛日夜女郎祠。\n翠钿尘网上蛛丝。\n澄海楼高空极目，望夫石在且留题。\n六王如梦祖龙非。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":996,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"纳兰性德","text":"夜雨做成秋，恰上心头。\n教他珍重护风流。\n端的为谁添病也，更为谁羞。\n密意未曾休，密愿难酬。\n珠帘四卷月当楼。\n暗忆欢期真似梦，梦也须留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":997,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"纳兰性德","text":"红影湿幽窗，瘦尽春光。\n雨余花外却斜阳。\n谁见薄衫低髻子，抱膝思量。\n莫道不凄凉，早近持觞。\n暗思何事断人肠。\n曾是向他春梦里，瞥遇回廊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":998,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"纳兰性德","text":"蜃阙半模糊，踏浪惊呼。\n任将蠡测笑江湖。\n沐日光华还浴月，我欲乘桴。\n钓得六鳖无？\n竿拂珊瑚。\n桑田清浅问麻姑。\n水气浮天天接水，那是蓬壶？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":999,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶杯","author":"纳兰性德","text":"知己一人谁是？\n已矣。\n赢得误他生。\n有情终古似无情，别语悔分明。\n莫道芳时易度，朝暮。\n珍重好花天。\n为伊指点再来缘，疏雨洗遗钿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":1000,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]